part 1. The historic West End is one of my favorite places to hang out in the city! All of these spots mentioned have great outdoor spaces to eat, drink, and spend time with friends. Grab your people and bar hop around to some of my favorite spots below: 

@mondaynightgarage 🍕🍻 
@leandrafthouse 🌮🍹
@aswdistillery 🥃🍸

Between the 3 of them, there’s always a fun event going on like throwback Thursdays & chef pop up series at @mondaynightgarage, music bingo & soccer watch parties at @leandrafthouse, and comedy shows & jazz nights at @aswdistillery (plus even more!)

Save this post as a reminder for fun things to do this weekend & let me know if you go check them out. 

